      "content": "Details of Kshethram:\nMoolavar: Hara Shapa Vimochana Perumal\nThayaar: Kamalavalli Thayaar\nVimanam: Kamalakrithi Vimanam\nPushkarani: Kapalamoksha Pushkarani\nTravel: This kshethram is located around 2 km from Tiruvaiyaru.\n\nAzhwar Pasuram: \nThirumangai Azhwar -1\n",
